    "created_at": "2015-09-07T16:55:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-07T16:55:26Z",
    "body": "This would be a substantial change as it would require switching `<mark>` from `HTMLElement` to `HTMLModElement`. As such you would need to gather support from browser vendors. Have you found any that are interested in implementing your proposal? I am a bit skeptical that making any changes to `<mark>` is going to make it on to their priority list, but you're welcome to try.\n\nOnce you have commitments from at least two browser vendors to implement this, then is an appropriate time to talk about updating the spec.\n",
